    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Parkour Block Puzzle Adventure</strong> is exactly what it sounds like \u2014 a unique blend of puzzle-solving, precision parkour, and strategic block placement, all set within ancient, mysterious dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t control the adventurer directly. Instead, you control the dungeon itself: placing blocks in real time to create paths, avoid hazards, and solve environmental puzzles. Your parkour adventurer runs, jumps, and climbs automatically \u2014 but only if you\u2019ve built the way forward correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 20 dungeons, each containing several levels. Completing dungeons earns you stars, which can be used to upgrade the adventurer\u2019s parkour skills. There are also deeper mysteries to uncover \u2014 why did the dwarves abandon these dungeons?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create your own adventures. The game lets you design the whole game world and individual levels from file-based templates. Share your creations with friends or the community by uploading them to the workshop.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Parkour Block Puzzle Adventure</strong> is exactly what it sounds like \u2014 a unique blend of puzzle-solving, precision parkour, and strategic block placement, all set within ancient, mysterious dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don\u2019t control the adventurer directly. Instead, you control the dungeon itself: placing blocks in real time to create paths, avoid hazards, and solve environmental puzzles. Your parkour adventurer runs, jumps, and climbs automatically \u2014 but only if you\u2019ve built the way forward correctly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features over 20 dungeons, each containing several levels. Completing dungeons earns you stars, which can be used to upgrade the adventurer\u2019s parkour skills. There are also deeper mysteries to uncover \u2014 why did the dwarves abandon these dungeons?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also create your own adventures. The game lets you design the whole game world and individual levels from file-based templates. Share your creations with friends or the community by uploading them to the workshop.</p>",
    "short_description": "Dungeon Parkour Block Puzzle Adventure is exactly what it sounds like. A dungeon puzzle-platformer where you place blocks to guide your adventurer, who parkours through the dungeons! Collect stars to upgrade adventurer's parkour skills.",
